  - m_Id: 1013338147
    m_Localized: YAPIMCILAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338148
    m_Localized: 'Geliştirici: Ramin Rasulzade'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338149
    m_Localized: "Unity 6000.6 (URP) \u2022 Apple Metal \u2022 WebGPU"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338150
    m_Localized: NASIL OYNARIM?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338151
    m_Localized: 1. KONTROLLER VE FIRLATMA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338152
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Raketi y\xF6nlendirmek i\xE7in parma\u011F\u0131n\u0131z ile sol veya sa\u011Fa kayd\u0131r\u0131n veya fareyi kayd\u0131r\u0131n.\n\u2022 Klavye: A/D veya Sol/Sa\u011F oklar.\n\u2022 Topu f\u0131rlatmak i\xE7in ekrana dokunun, t\u0131klay\u0131n veya Yukar\u0131/Bo\u015Fluk tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338153
    m_Localized: "2. D\u0130NAM\u0130K RAKET SEKMES\u0130"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338154
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Sekme a\xE7\u0131s\u0131 temas noktas\u0131na g\xF6re hesaplan\u0131r! Merkez dikey (90\xB0), kenarlar keskin a\xE7\u0131lar (30\xB0) \xFCretir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338155
    m_Localized: 3. PUANLAMA VE CAM BLOKLAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338156
    m_Localized: "\u2022 K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 = 10 puan \u2022 Ye\u015Fil = 20 puan \u2022 Mavi = 30 puan.\n\u2022 Cam Bloklar 2 vuru\u015F gerektirir: 1. vuru\u015F koruyucu kabu\u011Fu k\u0131rar, 2. vuru\u015F blo\u011Fu k\u0131r\u0131p 2 kat puan verir!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338157
    m_Localized: "4. G\xDC\xC7LEND\u0130RMELER VE TEHL\u0130KELER"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338158
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Geni\u015Fletici: Raketi +%10 b\xFCy\xFCt\xFCr.\n\u2022 \xC7arpanlar: Blok ba\u015F\u0131na 2X, 3X, 4X, 5X bonus puan.\n\u2022 Kalkan: 10 saniye kinetik koruyucu bariyer.\n\u2022 \xC7oklu Top: 3 top! Ekstra toplar can kaybettirmez.\n\u2022 Lazer: Blok s\u0131ralar\u0131n\u0131 delen ikiz toplar!\n\u2022 Bomba: Etraf\u0131ndaki kom\u015Fu bloklar\u0131 patlat\u0131r!\n\u2022 Ekstra Can: +1 can kazand\u0131r\u0131r (en fazla 5).\n\u2022 Kritik Geri Say\u0131m: Son 1 blok kald\u0131\u011F\u0131nda, 12 saniyelik saya\xE7 10X'e kadar puan verir veya Rayl\u0131 Silah blo\u011Fu buharla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12263776839946240
    m_Localized: "EN \u0130Y\u0130"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12263776898666496
